        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Panel of bizarre silk, France, 1695-1705"@en , "Panel of bizarre silk with elongated pierced and curving shapes brocaded in silver filé and frisé and salmon pink silk. The pattern is outlined and elaborated in the cream silk damask ground.\n\nThere is a selvedge on one side and, at the top, almost the entire width of the textile shows the comber repeat."@en ;
